H0\\\") (pintype \\\"bidirectional\\\")))\"},\n        {\"source\": \"spec\", \"quote\": \"HSE crystal (both MCUs) | FCC / NAVC | ABM8G-25.000MHZ-4Y-T3\"}\n      ],\n      \"impact\": \"The NAVC clock would not oscillate from the external crystal, so the MCU would run on its internal oscillator, or fail if the firmware requires HSE for USB, timing or GPS sync.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.2\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"The clearest deviation is the PCA9685PW address pin A0 tied to +3.3V, which moves the driver from the specified 0x40 to 0x41. The MCU supply and crystal wiring findings are lower-confidence because they may be netlist-export artifacts.\"\n}",
